              {
                "block_type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Test the parity factor. For even indices, $k = 2m$, so $(-1)^k = 1$ and $1 + (-1)^k = 2$. For odd indices, $k = 2m + 1$, so $(-1)^k = -1$ and $1 + (-1)^k = 0$.",
                "latex": "",
